{"seq":72,"slug":"regex-engine-implementation","title":"正则表达式引擎","stage":"DONE","category":"cs-fundamentals","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/regex-engine-implementation","rating":{"composite":3.66,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 正则表达式引擎\n\n写一个能匹配 `a*` 的程序很容易，写一个在任意输入下都不会卡死、还能正确处理捕获组和 Unicode 的正则引擎却很难。这两件事之间的鸿沟，正是这个 hub 想填平的内容。正则表达式既是程序员每天敲下的工具，又是一套有六十多年历史的数学理论；引擎实现就站在工程与理论的交界处——它既要尊重 Kleene 在 1951 年给出的代数，也要面对真实世界里恶意构造的输入和上百万行待匹配的日志。\n\n整个 hub 按四章组织，从抽象到具体层层落地，每一章都为下一章准备好概念地基。\n\n第一章「基础」回答「正则表达式到底是什么」。它从 Kleene 的正则代数讲起，澄清「正则语言」这个被计算理论严格定义过的概念，再把工程语法（`\\d`、`(...)`、`{2,5}`）和它的形式语义对应起来。这一章刻意区分了「理论上的正则」与「程序员口中的正则」——后者因为回引和前后查找早已超出前者的表达力，这个区分是理解后续一切引擎取舍的前提。\n\n第二章「自动机」是把理论变成可执行机器的桥梁。Thompson 构造法把正则表达式翻译成 NFA，子集构造法把 NFA 确定化成 DFA，而 Thompson 的同步模拟则展示了如何不显式构造 DFA 就实现线性时间匹配。这三篇构成了「自动机型」引擎的全部数学骨架。\n\n第三章「引擎实现」把骨架填成两种真实工程路线：以 PCRE、Java、JavaScript 为代表的回溯型引擎，和以 RE2、Rust regex 为代表的自动机型引擎。两条路线的根本分歧——是否支持回引、是否保证线性时间——决定了它们各自的特性边界与适用场景。\n\n第四章「进阶」是收口。它讲引擎为了实战速度而做的优化（字面量前缀、惰性 DFA、SIMD），讲回溯型引擎挥之不去的安全噩梦 ReDoS，也讲捕获组、回引、Unicode 这些让引擎真正可用却又充满陷阱的工程特性。\n\n读完四章，你应该能回答这样一个问题：当你在生产环境写下一条正则时，它背后那台机器会怎样运转，又会在什么输入下背叛你。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/regex-engine-implementation/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"regex-theory","title":"正则表达式的理论根基","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/regex-engine-implementation/foundations/regex-theory"},{"seq":2,"slug":"formal-languages","title":"形式语言与正则语言","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/regex-engine-implementation/foundations/formal-languages"},{"seq":3,"slug":"regex-syntax-semantics","title":"正则语法与语义","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/regex-engine-implementation/foundations/regex-syntax-semantics"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"automata","title":"自动机","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/regex-engine-implementation/automata","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"nfa-construction","title":"NFA 构造：Thompson 构造法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/regex-engine-implementation/automata/nfa-construction"},{"seq":2,"slug":"dfa-conversion","title":"子集构造：NFA 转 DFA","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/regex-engine-implementation/automata/dfa-conversion"},{"seq":3,"slug":"thompson-nfa","title":"Thompson NFA 模拟","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/regex-engine-implementation/automata/thompson-nfa"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"engines","title":"引擎实现","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/regex-engine-implementation/engines","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"backtracking-engines","title":"回溯型引擎","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/regex-engine-implementation/engines/backtracking-engines"},{"seq":2,"slug":"automata-engines","title":"自动机型引擎：RE2 路线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/regex-engine-implementation/engines/automata-engines"},{"seq":3,"slug":"engine-tradeoffs","title":"引擎取舍与特性边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/regex-engine-implementation/engines/engine-tradeoffs"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"advanced","title":"进阶","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/regex-engine-implementation/advanced","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"optimizations","title":"引擎优化技术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/regex-engine-implementation/advanced/optimizations"},{"seq":2,"slug":"redos-security","title":"ReDoS 与正则安全","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/regex-engine-implementation/advanced/redos-security"},{"seq":3,"slug":"practical-features","title":"工程特性：捕获组、回引与 Unicode","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/regex-engine-implementation/advanced/practical-features"}]}]}